    "title": "A child born with hypoplastic left heart syndrome is 6 months status post completion Fontan procedure. The child develops septic s",
    "scenario": "A child born with hypoplastic left heart syndrome is 6 months status post completion Fontan procedure. The child develops septic shock from pneumococcal pneumonia. SaO2 is 90% on FiO2 1. The cardiac index on dobutamine is 2.5 L/min/m2, hemoglobin is 8.2, lactate 4.8 mmol/L. How do you best increase tissue oxygen delivery?",
