    "correctAnswer": "E",
    "correctAnswerText": "Transfuse blood to a hemoglobin of 12",
    "explanation": "Oxygen Delivery\n• Oxygen delivery = CO x CaO2\n• CaO2 = (1.34 x Hb x SpO2) + (0.003 x\nPaO2)\n• Normal oxygen extraction ratio ~ 25%",
