    "scenario": "A 7 y.o. boy now 4 years post Fontan (total cavo-pulmonary anastomosis) for tricuspid atresia is scheduled for adenotonsillectomy. He takes captopril and aspirin. All of the following statements are TRUE EXCEPT:",
